<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">PETER Inkhat Changna Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peter</para>
  <para style="mt2">Inkhat Changna Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">1 Peter chemajia hi tirton Peter in ileimajia eii. Inphutna-ah Peter in hiwa chemajia ah ama hi tu ka-eme khat-um atu diang kimajiame tijarra amalar. Ama'n “Manmasituolla kaom mi rakip diang hiwa chemajia hin aril” (1 Peter 1:1-17), halli (1 Peter 2:11). Ama'n hiwa chemajia kateel ngaidiang hinthoa woi angjet aminkhi, ajarchu inmani rakip kha ram angjet-ah inlei inchekchai jarra eii. Halli hiwa chemajiahi Paul in Ephesian ngaidiang imajia chemajia chongramol lekkhatle inpuoruoi, mi angjet in 1 Peter hi Ephesia larik amajia suoli Christa innei suonuk kum 65 phaiwaiya inmajia lei ete tia ingamna. Peter in hiwa chemajiahi Babylon tia inkoi Rome makheiya iheimajia eii (1 Peter 5:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Peter in hinthoa aril, hiwa chemajia amajiana ajarchu, “Hiwahi kadik Pathian riangwai eii tia masoknale rilmalar nasik-ah imajia eii” (1 Pet 5:12). 1 Peter 2:11–3:7, Ephesia 5:18–6:9, khat-um Colossia 3:18–4:6 hi in-angna angjet om. Hiwa larik inthum ngai arup ngaihi insuungkhur innaitheina khat-um ranak kaneingai juisik minchuna jarra anapeii. Halli ama'n Christian ngaidiang aleimasok, kapoong karaal om kaalkhan kadei karaat eru ajarchu aphakha aheknasik naijei (1 Peter 4:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Peter in apumtak inrilsuok halli ama larik kateel ngai kha-um amalar <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Inmani'n inringkhuo sik-ah sanminringnahi inkhatli inkhat diang inmalarra inomkha Peter in Pathian kha aleiminpaak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:3-2:10">1:3–2:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Halli kangamna ngaikha manmasituolla katha-ah ringnasik khat-um anumeili aruothar halli suokli karu ngai'n innaiya omnasik jarra angjet aminchu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:11">2:11–4:11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Peter in kapoong karaal suok phakhan kadei karaat enasik ah aleimasok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 4:12-5:11">4:12–5:11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Insuona Chong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Jisu Christa suok, Peter makheiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Pathian ikadang mi ngai Pontus, Galatia, Cappadocia, Asia khat-um Bithynia ramsuung rakip ah innlei kaboi mi angnga inchekchaiya kaom <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />nangnikha Jisu Christa juinasik khat-um ama thisenkhan insuthiangnasik Nipa Pathian in ileijetmasa lungsing dungjuiya inakadang khat-um ama Ratha khan inthiang tia inabool mikha ning ejei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Riangwai khat-um kadai kha nangnidiang kasip erase.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ringnasik Ngamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Pathian khat-um eini Nipa Pumi Jisu Christa Pa ka-eii kha niraya-ah minpaakrui! ajarchu ama'n Jisu Christa kha kathi makheiya minringnook ah eini ngai rakip hi aminriang loknakhan kathar ringkhuo napejei. Hiwa'n einidiang ringnasik inngamna anaminsipjei. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Halli ama'n einisik-ah inadapi katamtak rawaan kha changthei nasik-ah matiang nisongnga niom. Ama'n marwaan ramma inadapi karei rakipkha nangni sik a-eii halli hiwahi inmani'n minmang theinunu, emakli minsetheinunu, khat-um chuoinunijei. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Hiwarakip ngaihi nangnisik eii, inngamna dungjuiya sanminring nasik beiya Pathian ranak in katha tak-ah ida kha, ahekna nikhuoni khan malarnasik beiya insuukchak-ah omjei.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Atuunnum aphakhat sik-ah nangni'n poongle raalna angjet ning-intongpui jarra kahoimak om innum, hiwa sik-ah rokro. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Nangni thosik danchu ingamna hi kadik eii tia minmusik, tichu minmangthei ka-eii soonna hi-um meiya inrouwa in-en inle nangni inngamna kha soonna neek ah kathadoom kha-um madan inta in-ensik eii, khawakha e-inchu nangni ngamna khan deimatorna neiningte. Halli Jisu Christa juoinlarni nangni'n minpaakna, lurlianna khat-um kayana kha muningte. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Pathian kha ningni'n ningmumak innum, ama kha ning minriang, halli tuun nangni'n ama kha ningmumak innum, nangni'n ama kha ningngamna khat-um rildan kaommak hoina lurnakhan nangnidiang asip, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />halli nangni'n amadiang ningngamna jarra ningratha sik-ah sanminringna kha ningmujei.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Hiwa sanminringna jarra Pathian chong kachoi ngai'n katha tak-ah in-entok in-ensuile inruoiya inmani'n hiwa Pathian napesik kutchoi jarra inleirilsuo ejei. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Inmani'n angkachang pha-ah khat-um angtho thoa ajuosikme tia inlei entok.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">angkachang pha-ah khat-um angtho thoa ajuosikme; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">atu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">miring kha esik me khat-um ama'n angtik ajuosik me.</char></note> Atuunna phahi ejei, halli Christa poongna intongpuinasik jarra khat-um ama lurlian nakhan amusik eii tia Christa Ratha'n inmani diang ileikhiinpi kha, atuunna phahin ejei. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Pathian in hiwa Pathian chongkachoi ngaidiang aleimalar, khachu inmani'n chuon inleitho kha inpumtak nemnasik emak takkha nangni nemnasik eii. Inmani ngai'n hiwa jarra inleiril kha marwaan makheiya kajuo Ratha inthiang ranak-ah taangwa ngai'n chong kahoi inleiril suokkha nangni'n atuun ningjetjei. Hiwa ngaihi eii marwaan tirton ngai innum inleijet zootkha.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inthiang Ringnasik ah Ikoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Khawajarra chuontho sik-ah ningmalung insuuktaru, malung insurthei eru, Jisu Christa ajuoni nangnidiang ajuochoisik riangwai kha ningmalungnga inngamna dataru. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Pathian chong kajui eru, halli kamo ringkhuo ah naleiring innum, nangni diangnga kaom kathamak malung khan intormaru. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Takkha nangni kanakoipa Pathian inthiang angnga nangni um ning chuontho rakip ah inthiangnga thoru. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Pathian chong in ati, “Inthiangkha eru ajarchu Keihi inthiang ka-eii.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Khat-um mirakip kha thenkhoi lekleiya chongkatan ama kha nangni'n Pa tia ningkoi, khawa e-inchu hiwa manmasituol hinnum khuol-injil ang inlang Pathian kachiya ringru. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Tichu nangni'n ningjet ang inme nipi nipu ngai kathamak chuontho makheiya nangnidiang katanna kanapeii. Khachu minmangthei ka-eii soonna dangka ka-ang emak. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Khawa khachu noonkuung kaommak khat-um kapop kaommak keelngamteii angnga aman katam Christa inpesuokna kha eii, <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Jisu Christa kha manmasituol aboolma ah ikadang suo ejei, takkha nangni ngai rakip sik-ah atuun apha heksitiang inamimu ejei. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Ama makheiya nangni rakip Pathian kha ningngamna eii, ama kha kathi makheiya aminring khat-um lurna apejei, khawa e-inchu nangni ingamnali rangaituina kha Pathian diang aomjei.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Atuunchu kadik kha ningjuijarra ningpumtak ning-insuthiangjei, khawajarra nangni'n ning-u ningnai ngai sik-ah kadik minriang nakha ningneijei, khatli inkhat malung inthiangnga inriangru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">malung inthiangnga; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat ah </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Namalung pumpuiya. </char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Tichu kathimak sik nulepa sa angnga nangnihi karing khat-um hektik kaneimak Pathian chong jarra ning inneithar ejei. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Khawajarra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Mirakip hi chinthou ka-ang in-eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">halli inmani lurnakha leiya reiparngai ka-ang in-eii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">chinthou kha lacharsik khat-um reiparkha lamangsik eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40:6-8</ref></char><verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Takkha Pumi chongkha inmang omnuni.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Hiwa chongkahoi hi-eii nangnidiang naleiripi.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Akaring Lungpui khat-um Inthiang Phunglezaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Khawajarra, nangni'n kathamak karil, maleisei karil, emakli katha inleem, kara-ot, emakli mikarilse chong kathamak rakip hi mathaanru. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Khat-um inneilim naitedoong ngai ang inlang apharakip ah inthiang ranutui kha rathalam sik-ah karaalchak eru, khawakha e-inchu nangni'n sanminringna ah ning insoonsik eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Atuunchu nangni'n Pumi hi angtuk kathame tihi ningjetjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Minpkla 34:8</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Mi ngai'n innahiaijuon anemna kaboi karing lungpui nangni kha Pumi diang ningheiwa inchu, Pathian in nangni hi kalurtheiya i-nakadang mi ning-ejei. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Nangni'n karing lungpui angnga heiwaru, halli nangni kha rathalamtiang biak-inn saknasik ah na-inliingnasik eii, khawa khan nangni hi Jisu Christa makheiya Pathian izoot rathalamtiang dooiphur ngai kapesik ah inthiang thiampu ngai angnga sepa kathosik ning-eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ajarchu Pathian chong in ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Enru, kei'n Zion na lung kiphun kha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">kei'n Zion sik-ah kikadang akilla kaom kalurthei lung kha ejei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">halli atu ka-ang in ama kha inngamna kanei'n angtik niteii injakna omnunijei.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Han hiwa lung kangamna nangni kha aman katamthei ning eii, takkha aka-ngamnamak inmani diangchu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">inn kasakpa'n kathamak eii tia ikalekjuon lungkha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">lung karra kathakhet lungkha aleiminchang jei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Minpkla 118:22</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Khat-um aleiilaak inthiang chong in ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Hiwa lunghi miringngai kaminsuisik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">halli inmani ngaikha minba nasik lung um a-eii.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Inmani'n insuina ajarchu inmani'n inthiang chong kha leingamnamu, hiwahi inmani sik ah Pathian lungdou eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa 8:14-15</ref></char><verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Takkha nangnichu innakadang mi ngaikha ning ejei, rengphung sik, inthiang zaatsik, Pathian misik, khat-um nangni ngaikha kaziing makheiya ama katha war khan anakoisuok jarra nangni'n Pathian chuontho loknakha karilthang sik-ah inakadang eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Suok 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">43:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 43:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Innidan 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref></char><verse eid="1PE 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Apha khatchu nangni Pathian mi ngai lei-emakchu, atuunchu Pathian mi ning ejei, halli apha khatchu Pathian minriangna kha leimumakchu, takkha atuunchu ama minriangna kha ningmujei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Suok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Minriang kaom ulenai ngai, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, khuolmi khat-um innlei kaboi angnga hiwa manmasituol hin! eini taksa ah raal kanatho manu chuonhi katho emui. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Nangni ngai rakip chuonna kathamak ah kanarilla kaom Pathian kajetmak zaatlop ngaidiang katha omchanna ringru, ajarchu ama juoni nichuontho katha li Pathian niminpaakna ngaihi inmani'n murasu.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Khale inruoiya Pumi sikbeiya ranak kanei mirakip diang e-innum, matorna kaneikhet reng diang e-innum, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />halli ramkaroon ngaidiang e-innum nangnikha inpeluutru, ajarchu inmani kha kathamak katho ngaidiang poongna kapesik khat-um katha katho ngaidiang kaminpaak sik-ah Pathian in ikadang eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Khawajarra kajetmak ngai'n ka-am chongril kha nangni'n katha tho-inlang min-omchianru, khawakha Pathian inmanuom kha eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ninglungdouwa karing mi eru, khat-um nangni lungdou kha kathamak makhu nasik ah inliingna maru. Takkha Pathian suok ang inlang ringru. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mi rakip kha kayaru, inngamna kanei aleiilaak diang minriangru, Pathian kha kayaru, khat-um reng ngaikha um kayaru.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa Poongna Omchan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Suok rakip in ning karu ngaikha kayaru, khat-um nangni ngaidiang katha kanatho inmani khabit emak ning kayasik khat-um akathamak karu diang um ning kayasik eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Nangni'n ngamnasik kaommak poongna kha ning intongpui inchu Pathian in rawaan napesik eii, ajarchu nangni'n Pathian lungdou sik-ah ning-ngaidon. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Halli nangni'n kathamak natho jarra ramol nabak inchu angme nanemna kaom, takkha nangni'n kadik ningtholi poongna ningnei inchu Pathian in nangni kha rawaan napesik eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Hiwasik-ah Pathian in nangni kha inakoisuok eii, ajarchu Christa in napoong piya omchan kathakha naleidapi, khawajarra ningni'n ama omchan kha ningjuisik eii. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Halli ama'n manu thomak, khat-um ama baisuo makheiya maleisei inkhatbit um iril jetmakmi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Amakha inrilthai kaalkhan, ama'n kase ah masang kirnookmak, ama kha inminpoong kaalkhan, woikhat maleiikirsik thomak, takkha akadik chongtan nikhan Pathian om tia ama inngamna kha ada. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Khale inruoiya Christa Jisu apumtak in eini manu rakip cross ah anaroonpi, khawajarra eini'n manu khan thimator nite halli akadiksik um ringmator nite. Ama napoppi nakhan eini nidamjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Khawajarra nangni'n keelngam inkhat in alam iminchai ka-ang ning eii, takkha atuunchu nangni ngai ratha kanakhaalpi keelngam kakhaalpa diang ning heikirjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Inkanei Numeisa ngai khat-um Inkanei Pasal ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Hiwa angnga numeisa ngai innum ningruothar nuoiya ning omsik eii, itichu atu ka-ang in Pathian chongkha inmani'n inngamnamak innum, numeisa nang naomchan katha'n inmani kha minngamna matorna naneisik eii. Halli chong minchu nasik arei omnunijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Eph 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Col 3:18</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Ajarchu inmani'n nang inthiangnali kayana omchankha inmusik eii. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Halli nang nathana kha putiangnga min-emaro, nasamchoiya, emakli soonna nabet na-ah, emakli retruo nathona ah, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Tim 2:9</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />khawaneek achu suungnga namalung katha kha namin esik, Pathian izoot arei kaomkhet chuoitik kaommak katha khat-um malungkadai li nunchan inchuol kha eru. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Khawajarra tiallaiya inthiang numeisa ngai'n Pathian diang inngamna inda-ah inpumkha inruothar diang inpeluut ah inthana inminchang. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Sarah in, Abraham chongkha ajui, halli amadiang karu tia akoi, nangni'n akatha kha ningthoa halli iteii kha nangni'n ningchimak inchu ama sanu ngaikha ning ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Inphut 18:12</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Hiwa angnga pasal ngai innum ngaidonru, malung inmuwa ning numeile omsuomru, khat-um inmani kha nang neek-ah kasuol mi eii tia kaya inlang sepa thoru halli ningringkhuoa nangnile kaomsik kapoithei kutchoi eii ti-inlang leiru khawakha e-inchu nangni'n Pathian ningni rakip ah kana-ook omnuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Eph 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Col 3:19</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katha thonasik ah Poongna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Hekna-ah nangni ngairakip, khatli inkhat diang ningngaidon khat-um ningmanuom ningmin angripsik eii, inkhatli inkhat inriangru khat-um malung kadai eru halli malung inniam eru. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Halli nangni'n kathamak li kathamak ah emakli khomaak li khomaak ah inleiikir maru, khaneek achu rawaanna inpekirru, ajarchu hiwa thonasik ah inakoisuok eii, khawa e-inchu nangni'n rawaan ningmusik eii. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Chong inthiang in inti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Atu ka-ang in aring khuokha kaminriang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">halli nikhuo katha angjet amuzoot inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">nangni'n kathamak karil</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">khat-um maleisei karil ningdasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Minpkla 34:12-16</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Nangni'n kathamak makkheiya inlet inlang katha thoru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">nangni'n kadai ning entoksik halli khawakha ningsongsik eii.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ajarchu Pumi'n kadik mi ngaikha ompuichak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">halli inmani ngai Pathian ninakha arangaipi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">takkha Pumi'n kathamak katho ngaidiangchu enzootmak.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nangni kha katha kathozoot thei ning e-inle tu-in naminse niame? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Takkha nangni katha sikbeiya poongna ningnei inchu nangnikha rawaan katha ning eii! nangni'n tuteii chimaru khat-um malung mindong maru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Matt 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa 8:12-13</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Takkha nangni malungnga Christa kha china neiru halli ama kha Pumi eii tia kayaru. Khat-um apha rakip ah nangni inngamna jarra kanarakelsik mirakip diang kamasangsik-ah inringchak in omru, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />halli kayale inruoiya malung inniamma thoru, nangni kase katha jetna malungkha inthiangnga daru, khawakha e-inchu nangnidiang innarilse phakhan, nangni'n Christa ningjui jarra katha omchan ningthokha kathamak ah kanarilse inmani'n innarilna jarkhan jakna inmusik eii. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Han kathamak kathosik neek achu, Pathian lungduo e-inchu kathasik beiya kapoong kha atha. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Khawale inruoiya Christa'n manu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">La­rik katam khat achu ka­poong.</char></note> sik-ah woikhatbit nathipijei, Nangnikha Pathian diang nakeiruoi nasik-ah katha mi khan manu karoon ngai rathuulla nathipi halli ama kha taksa ah inleithat han ratha ah aminringjei. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Halli ama ratha kha asiya inkhumma inda ratha ngaidiang chong juorilpi. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Khawa ngai khachu tiallai Noah pha ah ama'n rakuong boollai, Pathian in malung kadaiya i-ngaak chongkajui makngai ratha diang eii. Hiwa rakuong suungnga kaleiom mi chu lekteii in-eii halli miring kariat khabit inlei eii tui makheiya isanring. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Inphut 6:1–7:24</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Halli hiwa tui'n injetnachu tuikaluut tina eii, halli atuunchu nangni ringna ningmujei. Hiwahi napumkachok iminthiang chian emak, takkha malung inthiangnga Pathian diang chongkhitna nibool kha eii. Halli Jisu Christa ihongring kha'n nangni kha ningring ejei, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ama'n marwaan tiang akalla Pathian kutchangtiang aomjei, halli marwaan tirton ngai, matornali ranakngai chungnga ama'n wai roonjei.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Pathian sik-ah Karing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Khale inruoiya Christa'n einisik-ah apumtak-ah napoongpijei, han nangni-um ama malungroonle in-angrip kinnei tia ngaidon inlang ranak songru, ajarchu atu ka-ang in taksa poongna kanei mikha manu ah poong nunijei. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Halli atuun makheiya nangni'n ninglaringsik ringkhuo hi Pathian lungduo nuoiya ningring sikjei, khat-um manmasi ngai imanuom ringkhuoa ringnutunjei. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Khawale inruoiya nangni'n akatheng ringkhuoa zaatlop ngai'n inthozoot ka-emak omchan, zool-inthai, ju inrui, ka-emak katho, ju inruiya kahoi, khat-um miramil chubei katho ngaihi nangni'n ningthoa aphakha kahunna ningminthengjei. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Halli nangni'n inmani kathamak ringna khat-um chuon ka-uoimak khan ning inchelmak jarra inmani'n ngakna innei, halli inmani'n nangnikha narilthaina innei. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Akaring khat-um akathi chong katansik insuuk-ah kaom amadiang inmani'n intheinuoa inchuon thomankha Pathian diang inpeluutsik eii. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Khawajarra hiwasik bit-ah eii akathiya kaom inmani diang um chongkahoi inleirilpi, han inmani kha mi rakip taksa dungjuiya chong intan angnga inmani um chong intansik eii, takkha inmani'n ratha tiang Pathian angnga inringsik eii.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Kutchoi dungjuiya katha silpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Angrakip aheknasik phakha anaijei. Khawajarra malung insurthei khat-um malung inringchak eru khawakha e-inchu nangni'n Pathian kanimator eningte. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Achungnga angrakip ngai neek ah, khatle inkhat malung inthiangnga inriangru, ajarchu minriang in manu angjet amakhu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Chongngil 10:12</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Inkhatli inkhat diang inrilse elekleiya indonthei eru. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Pathian silpu katha angnga mi rakip in inlak kutchoi ning imu ngaikha mi ngai sepa katha ah thonasik eii. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Atu ka-ang karil mi khan Pathian chongkha rilrase; halli atu ka-ang sepa katho mi khan Pathian in amadiang ipeii ranak khan sepa kha thorase, khale inruoiya angrakip inpaakna kha Jisu Christa diangnga inphut Pathian diang perasu, ajarchu lurna khat-um ranak hi kumsoot ah amata eii. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christian ni-ejarra Poongna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Minriang kaom ulenai ngai, nangni chungnga madanna poongna kanathei ning intongpui kaalkhan hiwahi nangnidiang suoksik ka-emak kasuok ti inlang ngakmaru. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Khawaneek achu Christa poongna kha kindeisuom eii ti-inlang rokna neiru, ama poina juo-inlarni nangnidiang rokna khan asipsik eii. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Nangni kha Christa ramingsik beiya innarilthai inchu, rawaam katha kha ning eii, ajarchu Ratha poinale Pathian ratha kha nangnidiang aom. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Nangni poongna ningnei khachu, mi kathat, emakli inruup, emakli kathamak angjet katho, emakli achuon eleiya mi ngai chuonna inchelraat enasik emak. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ang ka-ang e-innum, nangni'n Christian ning ejarra ningpoong inchu injakkhai maru, takkha Christa raming ningroon jarra Pathian kha minpaakru.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Tichu Pathian kajet insuungkhur rakip diangnga inphut mansakhet chongtan nasik aphakha ajuotung sikjei; halli einidiang inphut masa-inle Pathian chongkahoi hi mi ngaidiang le angkachang omchanna esikme? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Chong inthiang in iti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Akatha mi ngai sanringnasik-ah intak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">kha e-inle Pathian kajetmak manu karoon ngai diangleii ang suoksikme?”<char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Chongngil 11:31</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Khawakha e-inchu, atu ka-ang Pathian lungdouwa poongna kanei ngaichu huoikajoua inmani kaboolpa Pathian diang inpumkha inpesuoksik eii, halli katha kha-um insong cheiya inom sik eii.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Pathian Keelngam ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Kei'n koisuok karoon inkhat kachangnga koisuok karoon ngaidiang kanati, khawa khachu keihi Christa poongna raalna jarra sakhi ka-eii halli kei'n akalajuosik lurlian nakha kalachansik eii. Kei'n nangnidiang kanatinook <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Pathian in inapeii keelngam rahooingai kakhaalsik chuonkha malung karok ah thoru, Pathian i-naminthozoot dungjuiya thoru khat-um ningthozoot makpumma thomaru. Nangni ningchuon kha sialsum munasik bit-ah thomaru, takkha malung inthiangnga sepa thoru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Jn 21:15-17</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Han nangnidiang keiruoisik ah innapeii mi ngai chungnga wai roonnasik thomaru, takkha keelngam rahooi ngaidiang omchan kathakha inchangru. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Halli akaliankhet keelngam kakhaalpa ajuo kaalkhan nangnidiang kachuoi kaboi lurna renglukhu kha ningmusik eii.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Khangdoong ngai hiwa angnga upa ngaidiang ningpum kha peluutru. Nangni rakip ngai'n khatli khatdiang nunchan kaom puondiar kha inlukru, ajarchu, chong inthiang in ati, “Pathian in in-or mi ngaikha zootmak, takkha nunchan inchuol mi ngaidiang riangwai kha apeii.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Chongngil 3:34</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Pathian ranak kutnuoiya ningtheinuoa nunchan inchuol eru, khawakha e-inchu ama'n nangni kha apha kachatak ah nakadom saangsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Matt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Nangni malung dongna rakip ah Pathian diang peluutru, ajarchu ama'n nangnikha anaompui.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Inringchakru, insingtheiru! nangni kana-inhalpui Seitan kha sabakkai inraam angnga aloonna om, halli miring inkhat einasik-ah a-enna aom. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Nangni inngamnakha micheetru, halli Seitan kha zootmaru, ajarchu manmasituol pumpuiya kaom ning-u ningnai kangamna ngaikha hiwale in-angrip poong nakha indeiya inom. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Khat-um nangni'n aphakhat ningpoong ningraal suoli angrakip ah riangwai kanei Pathian in Christa diang eini ngaihi ama hektik kaboi lurlian nakha munasik ah inakoi ejei, halli ama'n akathakhet namin-esik eii, halli intir lekleiya omnasik, ranak khat-um kadik ah ngirtheina kha anapesik eii. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Amadiang hektik kaboi ranak kha omrase! Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Chongmathaanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Kei'n huoikajuotak Christian ulenai inkhat eii tia kilei Silas in nasan jarra hiwa kabong chemajia hi kimajia mator eii. Kei'n nangnidiang kanamasokzoot khat-um kei karingkhuo thurchi hi kanarilpizoot hiwa ngaihi inthiangnga Pathian riangwai kha eii. Hiwahin nangni'n kacheet-ah ngirru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Chuon 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Nangnile inakadang suom Babylon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Babylon</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Chongmalar larik dungjuiya hiwahi Rome diang iminkhi eii.</char></note> na kaom koisuok ngai innum nangnidiang inpaakna inheimathuon, halli kei kasapa Mark innum inpaakna anaheipeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Chuon 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Col 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Philem 24</ref> </char><verse eid="1PE 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Khatli inkhat diang Christian inriangna ah inzoop inlang indonru.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Christa diangnga kaom nangni ngairakip chungnga kadai kha omrase.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>